> As a Project Manager for the Advisor Team, I work to ensure that the team’s growth is supported through various development efforts through the year. Our advisors need the right tools in place to provide the best experience for our members, and I make sure that we are always adapting those tools and resources to suit our members’ needs.
Exploring the music scene around the Twin Cities, cooking for[ friends, and] traveling with good company.[ I also love] water sports like sailing and kayaking!
[I] would[ be] a hot cup of[ tea] because[ I love] facilitating good conversation[ and] bringing[ people] together[. I] am most fulfilled[ when] I feel useful and productive[, just as] tea can also be medicinal and serve a purpose.[][][][][][]

